    <briefdescription>
<para>Called when a player swings their arm. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Cancelling stops the server acting on the swing at all. The swing is neither recorded nor shown to the other players in the dimension.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The swinging player still sees their own arm move, because their client plays the animation without waiting for the server. The event covers swings the player starts. Swings the server drives itself, such as dropping an item, do not fire it. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
